      "bio_id": "Arya adalah mantan atlet renang profesional yang telah menekuni dunia renang sejak tahun 2010. Berbekal pengalaman sebagai atlet, sejak tahun 2021 Arya mendedikasikan dirinya sebagai coach renang untuk membantu lebih banyak orang mengenal, menguasai, dan mencintai olahraga renang. momen paling berharga menjadi seorang coach bukan sekadar melihat murid berhasil berenang, tetapi menyaksikan senyum mereka ketika berhasil mengatasi rasa takut terhadap air dan menemukan kepercayaan diri di dalamnya.Baginya, berenang adalah sebuah pintu gerbang menuju petualangan yang lebih luas. Ketika kamu sudah bisa berenang, dunia air terbuka untuk dijelajahi. Mulai dari freediving untuk mengeksplorasi keindahan bawah laut, surfing menaklukkan ombak, hingga berbagai aktivitas air lainnya.\n\n\"Learning to swim is not just about learning to move in the water. It's about building confidence, overcoming fear, and opening the door to a whole new world of adventures.\"\n\n— Coach Arya",
      "bio_en": "Arya is a former professional swimmer who has been dedicated to the sport since 2010. Drawing from his experience as a competitive athlete, he transitioned into coaching in 2021, with a mission to help more people discover, master, and enjoy the art of swimming.\n\nFor Arya, the most rewarding part of being a coach is not simply watching students learn to swim, but seeing the smiles on their faces when they overcome their fear of water and gain confidence in themselves.\n\nArya believes that **everyone should know how to swim.** Swimming is more than just a sport; it is an essential life skill that can benefit us throughout our lives.\n\nTo him, swimming is a gateway to a whole new world of possibilities and adventures. Once you know how to swim, you can explore the beauty of the ocean through freediving, ride the waves with surfing, experience the thrill of cliff jumping, and enjoy countless other water activities.\n\n**\"Learning to swim is not just about learning to move in the water. It's about building confidence, overcoming fear, and opening the door to a whole new world of adventures.\"**\n\n— Coach Arya",
